%% Sequence diagram UC1: profile creation and component selection.
%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Arial, sans-serif","fontSize":"16px"},"sequence":{"actorMargin":24,"messageMargin":18,"boxMargin":6,"boxTextMargin":4,"noteMargin":6,"useMaxWidth":true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as User
    participant UI as Admin UI
    participant API as HTTP API
    participant Registry as Plugin Registry
    participant Profile as Profile Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Admin->>UI: Open profile page
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/profiles
    API-->>UI: Existing profiles
    Admin->>UI: Open create form
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/profiles/create-options
    API->>Registry: Read active plugin manifests
    Registry-->>API: Schemas and capabilities
    API-->>UI: Plugin options
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/datasources
    API-->>UI: Datasource options
    Admin->>UI: Submit profile and nodes
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/profiles
    API->>Profile: Validate datasource and node configs
    Profile->>Registry: Resolve plugin versions
    Registry-->>Profile: Validated manifests
    Profile->>DB: Insert profile and nodes
    DB-->>Profile: Commit transaction
    Profile-->>API: Profile created
    API-->>UI: Profile detail
